    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100607" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνθηρ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hunt together, join in the chase</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.3.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισι</span>
			<i>with</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.1.14
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				38
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>catch</i> or <i>find together</i>, in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν δέ νιν θηρώμεθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					433
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρες . .
			συνθηρώμεναι</span> hands <i>caught and bound together</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1005
			</span></i>.</div>
